   3.977100959774529*^9, 
   3.977100960449031*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a9784ab9-1c7f-4641-ab17-\
78b669049650"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Notation: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] has easy input forms for \
abstractly indexed tensors. These input forms as small as possible while \
being unambiguous, e.g., ",
 StyleBox["T[\[ScriptCapitalU][\[Mu]],\[ScriptCapitalD][\[Nu]]]", "Input"],
 ". \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]\[CloseCurlyQuote]s output forms match \
typeset notebooks and papers as closely as possible, e.g., ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"T", 
   SuperscriptBox["", "\[Mu]"], 
   SubscriptBox["", "\[Nu]"]}]],
  CellChangeTimes->{3.976803539290485*^9, 3.9768036794529448`*^9, 
   3.976806303053437*^9, 3.9768071322349453`*^9, 3.976809552657373*^9, 
