   3.976923246222611*^9, 3.9769233204553328`*^9}, {3.9769234671066113`*^9, 
   3.9769235014678307`*^9}, 3.9771008501016808`*^9, {3.977100953570056*^9, 
   3.977100954334907*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"466f5281-987d-4311-85c1-\
a3af72defef8"],

Cell["\<\
Rigour: \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] handles renaming of \
contraction-bound (dummy) indices via alpha-conversion, preventing the \
index-capture errors that plague pen-and-paper derivations.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
   3.976807258054213*^9, 3.976807372892746*^9}, {3.9768074213746433`*^9, 
