Cell["\<\
This work builds upon my previous notebooks on special and general \
relativity, where \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] \
(\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Up/Down\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]) notation was first \
introduced to disambiguate covariant and contravariant indices.\
\>", "Text",
