Cell["\<\
To ensure this notebook is self-contained and reproducible, the entire source \
code for \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD]\[CloseCurlyQuote]s relativity \
toolkit, with its unit tests and regression tests, is included inline here. \
In future installments of this series, as the codebase grows, we will \
transition to open-source distribution hosted on GitHub.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.976805343965353*^9, {3.976807171258144*^9, 3.976807218345378*^9}, {
